WEBVTT

01:36.800 --> 01:38.930
(改编自乔治RR马丁小说 “血火同源”)

01:41.260 --> 01:45.020
龙族前传
第三季第一集

01:41.260 --> 01:45.020
本WEB版外挂字幕由  风吹来的那片云  双语合并

02:49.580 --> 02:50.580
冷静

02:53.630 --> 02:54.630
冷静

04:09.700 --> 04:10.700
跪下
Kneel.

04:15.540 --> 04:17.630
我可以给你个痛快 或是...
I can make it clean, or...

04:17.710 --> 04:19.760
至少让我知道我的罪名吧 王子殿下
Might I at least know the accusation, my prince?

04:19.840 --> 04:21.050
告诉我他在哪里
Where is he?

04:21.840 --> 04:23.590
- 谁  - 我哥哥 国王
- Who? - My brother, the king.

04:23.720 --> 04:24.800
在他的寝宫
In his quarters!

04:26.010 --> 04:27.890
你是王室的叛徒
You are a traitor to the crown.

04:28.390 --> 04:30.020
- 我判你死刑 - 不
- I sentence you to die. - No!

04:30.140 --> 04:31.140
王子殿下
My prince.

04:32.810 --> 04:35.940
看来拉里斯大人也逃离了红堡
It appears Lord Larys has fled the Keep as well.

04:50.910 --> 04:52.700
我需要罂粟花奶
I need milk of the poppy.

04:53.250 --> 04:55.960
我们匆忙逃走 无暇顾及
I'm afraid in our hasty flight that I neglected to bring any.

04:56.080 --> 04:57.790
好痛
Ah, the pain!

04:57.920 --> 04:59.250
拜托
Please.

04:59.380 --> 05:00.380
拜托
Please.

05:01.880 --> 05:03.220
振作起来 国王陛下
Take heart, my king.

05:04.260 --> 05:05.970
现在是黑暗的时刻 但是...
These are dark hours, but...

05:07.300 --> 05:08.930
好日子就在眼前了
brighter days lie ahead.

05:09.180 --> 05:10.220
不
No.

05:10.640 --> 05:11.640
不
No.

05:13.100 --> 05:14.680
我是一无所有之王
I'm the king of nothing.

05:15.770 --> 05:17.770
以渡鸦粪便为王座
With raven shit for a throne

05:18.400 --> 05:20.570
瘸子为守护者
and a cripple for a protector.

05:21.730 --> 05:23.400
我真可悲
Oh, I'm fucking pathetic.

05:27.610 --> 05:28.660
该死
Oh, fuck!

05:33.120 --> 05:34.120
把兜帽拉上
Draw your hood.

05:34.620 --> 05:35.710
趴下

05:49.470 --> 05:51.050
待在原地

05:51.850 --> 05:53.890
等等...拜托帮忙一下
Wait, no, wait!

05:59.730 --> 06:00.730
你们是什么人
Who are you?

06:01.230 --> 06:03.530
为学城效力的普通百姓
Simple men in service of the Citadel.

06:05.280 --> 06:07.070
我们要把这些渡鸦送去白港
We're taking these ravens to White Harbor.

06:07.200 --> 06:09.200
你们身处女王的疆土
You're in the queen's lands.

06:09.660 --> 06:13.290
若想由此通过 必须先谴责篡位者
If you mean to pass, you first have to denounce the usurper,

06:13.580 --> 06:17.160
屈膝下跪 向女王陛下宣誓效忠
bend the knee. You swear fealty to Her Grace,

06:17.290 --> 06:20.670
唯一真王 雷妮拉坦格利安
the one true queen, Rhaenyra Targaryen.

06:25.460 --> 06:27.380
我们谴责篡位者
We denounce the usurper

06:27.670 --> 06:30.840
并向雷妮拉坦格利安陛下宣誓效忠
and swear to Her Grace, Rhaenyra Targaryen.

06:36.640 --> 06:37.930
来吧 朋友
Come on, friend.

06:38.140 --> 06:40.310
宣誓你的效忠 我们才能继续赶路
Affirm your fealty so we might be on our way.

06:44.940 --> 06:46.440
队长要你跪下
The captain said kneel.

06:46.570 --> 06:47.780
去你的
Fuck you.

06:54.450 --> 06:56.410
请原谅我的朋友 他有点不知变通
Forgive my friend, he can be so stubborn.

06:56.830 --> 06:58.040
他们是伊耿的人
They're for Aegon.

06:58.910 --> 07:00.370
将他们就地正法
Put them to the sword.

07:00.540 --> 07:02.750
- 不 饶了我... - 大人 你今天走运了
- Wait, please. Please. - It's a very lucky day for you, my lord.

07:05.130 --> 07:09.170
此人不愿宣誓效忠雷妮拉
The reason this man won't swear fealty to Rhaenyra...

07:11.680 --> 07:13.930
是因为他就是伊耿坦格利安
is because he is Aegon Targaryen.

07:16.010 --> 07:17.020
什么
What?

07:17.810 --> 07:19.770
不是...那太...
No, no, that's--

07:19.890 --> 07:21.650
朋友 你在玩什么把戏
What are you playing at, friend?

07:21.730 --> 07:22.940
他就是爱开玩笑
Always jesting.

07:23.020 --> 07:25.520
- 他说的是实话吗  - 不是...
- That true? - No.

07:25.610 --> 07:27.280
当然不是 这根本是无稽之谈
No, of course not. These are lies.

07:27.400 --> 07:28.690
他在鸦栖堡战役中
He was lustrated in dragonfire

07:28.780 --> 07:31.860
被雷妮丝坦格利安 与她的龙用龙焰洗礼
by Rhaenys Targaryen... and her dragon at the Battle of Rook's Rest.

07:31.990 --> 07:36.740
- 我的同伴很擅长编故事娱乐... - 我是效忠陛下的臣子
- My companion is always the gifted mummer. - I am His Grace's loyal councillor...

07:36.830 --> 07:38.950
- 赫伦堡的领主 拉里斯斯壮 - 睁眼说瞎话
- ...and the Lord of Harrenhal-- - Outrageous fucking lies!

07:39.080 --> 07:40.580
你们两个之中有人说谎
Someone's lying.

07:40.870 --> 07:42.000
- 这是他的王冠 - 不是
- His crown. - No.

08:01.850 --> 08:03.440
头发很漂亮
Pretty hair.

08:05.730 --> 08:07.230
砍下他们的脑袋
Take their heads.

08:08.020 --> 08:09.900
这能跟女王换取丰厚的赏金
We'll make a rich bounty for the queen.

08:10.030 --> 08:12.030
- 请大人恕罪 但要是走错这一步 - 不...饶了我
- Forgive me, my lord... - No, no, no, please.

08:12.110 --> 08:13.200
你连自己的脑袋都保不住
...but you would lose your own head for such a misstep.

08:14.700 --> 08:16.910
这就是挑战者本人
This is the challenger himself.

08:18.740 --> 08:21.290
只要将他和最受他信任的心腹
You can name your price for delivering him...

08:21.790 --> 08:24.870
以俘虏的身分交给女王
and his most trusted confidant to the queen

08:25.460 --> 08:27.340
价码随你开
as living hostages.

08:29.500 --> 08:30.920
那他们又是什么身分
Who are they, then?

08:31.210 --> 08:32.630
无关紧要的人
No one of consequence.

08:36.390 --> 08:39.180
- 最近的港口在哪里  - 暮谷镇
- What's the nearest port? - Duskendale.

08:40.140 --> 08:42.600
把他们关好 带过去
Bar them within. We'll take them there.

08:43.980 --> 08:45.810
雇一艘船去龙石岛
And hire a ship to Dragonstone.

08:49.020 --> 08:50.440
我很想相信
I have to believe...

08:52.070 --> 08:54.320
阿莉森是真心想谈和
that Alicent's offer was genuine.

08:55.410 --> 08:58.740
这只是打着过去友谊旗帜的诡计
It is a ruse cloaked in stale friendship.

08:58.870 --> 09:01.750
她来这里无疑冒了很大的风险
The risk she took in coming here is beyond question.

09:02.790 --> 09:04.540
那她现在要你冒的风险呢
And the risk she now asks you to take?

09:07.460 --> 09:12.420
光凭她的片面之词 就飞去绿党的要塞
To fly to the Greens' stronghold based on her word alone.

09:14.670 --> 09:16.760
这是个陷阱 母亲
It is a trap, Mother...

09:17.510 --> 09:21.010
引诱你和戴蒙 进入瓦格哈尔的血盆大口
to lure you and Daemon into Vhagar's jaws.

09:21.140 --> 09:24.930
不 瓦格哈尔和伊蒙德不在 他们飞去赫伦堡了
No! Vhagar and Aemond are gone. They have flown to Harrenhal.

09:25.060 --> 09:28.900
而伊耿卧病在床
And Aegon is bedridden.

09:37.740 --> 09:41.830
我可以一举拿下伊耿和王位
I could take both Aegon and the throne in a single stroke.

09:41.950 --> 09:42.950
不
No.

09:44.080 --> 09:46.210
你不能相信她
You cannot trust her.

09:48.210 --> 09:49.540
母亲
Mother.

09:52.630 --> 09:54.340
阿莉森来到龙石岛了
Alicent came to Dragonstone.

09:54.420 --> 09:55.470
阿莉森
Alicent?

09:55.590 --> 09:57.470
打着和平的旗帜
Under a banner of peace.

09:57.550 --> 09:58.800
这怎么可能
Surely, this is not possible.

09:58.930 --> 10:01.720
绿党明白他们的战败已成定局
The Greens know already that their defeat is written.

10:04.180 --> 10:08.940
伊蒙德乘着瓦格哈尔 飞往河间地与科尔会合
Aemond flies on Vhagar to join Cole in the Riverlands.

10:09.520 --> 10:13.980
他离开后 阿莉森就会打开红堡
With him gone, Alicent will open the gates of the Red Keep

10:14.110 --> 10:15.940
把伊耿交给我处置
and surrender Aegon to me.

10:16.030 --> 10:18.490
我会取下他的首级与王位
I will then take his head and the throne.

10:18.570 --> 10:20.570
她提出什么条件 女王陛下
What are her terms, Your Grace?

10:20.660 --> 10:23.120
饶她 海伦娜和杰赫妮拉一命
That she, Helaena, and Jaehaera are spared,

10:23.200 --> 10:25.620
在不造成更多伤亡的情况下 结束这场战争
and that this war ends without further bloodshed.

10:25.700 --> 10:26.910
这个代价微不足道
That is a low price.

10:27.040 --> 10:29.000
你认为她值得信任吗
Do you believe she can be trusted?

10:29.080 --> 10:30.710
传话给在喉道的科利斯大人
Get word to Lord Corlys in the Gullet.

10:30.830 --> 10:33.920
我需要船只运送足够的兵力 来拿下那座城市
I require ships to deliver fighting men enough to secure the city.

10:34.000 --> 10:37.130
- 女王陛下 我强烈抗议此举... - 戴蒙必须尽快回来
- Your Grace, I protest this action with all my po-- - And Daemon must return with haste.

10:37.260 --> 10:38.590
我会写信给他
I'll write to him.

10:39.800 --> 10:41.800
我们两天后飞往君临
We'll fly to King's Landing in two days' time...

10:43.430 --> 10:44.720
拿下那座城市
and take the city.

10:56.030 --> 10:57.070
早安 爵士
Good morrow, ser.

10:57.490 --> 11:00.610
皇后 国王要召见你
My queen. The king requires an audience.

11:17.050 --> 11:19.340
请移驾至王座厅 陛下
Rather to the throne room, Your Grace.

11:33.650 --> 11:34.650
伊蒙德
Aemond.

11:40.990 --> 11:42.110
你怎么会在这里
Why are you here?

11:49.830 --> 11:52.000
伊耿已经退位了
Aegon has abdicated the throne.

11:53.960 --> 11:55.210
退位 什么意思
Abdicated? What do you mean?

11:55.290 --> 11:58.460
跟癞蛤蟆拉里斯一起逃离君临了
Fled King's Landing with that toad Larys.

11:59.840 --> 12:02.800
不对 伊耿卧病在床
No, Aegon was bedridden.

12:03.640 --> 12:05.140
他还能去哪里 为什么要这么做
Where could he have gone? Why?

12:05.390 --> 12:07.720
因为他不仅是个懦夫 还很愚蠢
Because he's even more stupid than he is craven.

12:09.020 --> 12:11.350
我们得派出搜索队 必须马上找到他
We must send a search party. He needs to be found immediately.

12:11.770 --> 12:13.730
你去哪了 母亲
Where were you, Mother?

12:15.190 --> 12:17.440
你好几天没出现在红堡了
You've not been seen in the Keep in days.

12:25.910 --> 12:27.780
我去了御林 伊蒙德
I was in the Kingswood, Aemond.

12:28.700 --> 12:30.950
我最近发现自己在这里没什么用处
I have found myself of little use here of late.

12:35.080 --> 12:36.460
那赫伦堡呢
And what of Harrenhal?

12:38.040 --> 12:39.880
你和瓦格哈尔 本该飞去见克里斯顿爵士
You and Vhagar were meant to fly to meet Ser Criston

12:40.000 --> 12:41.460
协力挑战戴蒙
and challenge Daemon together.

12:43.720 --> 12:46.890
伊耿让我别无选择 只能留在这里保卫这座城市
Aegon has left me no choice but to remain here and defend the city.

12:49.760 --> 12:52.140
但援军就要来了
But aid is coming.

12:52.430 --> 12:54.810
欧尔蒙大人和海塔尔家的 一万五千名士兵
Lord Ormund and 15,000 Hightower men

12:54.890 --> 12:57.360
此刻正与戴伦和他的龙 一起沿着曼德河而上
presently march up the Mander with Daeron and his dragon.

12:57.690 --> 13:00.610
三女儿王国的舰队随时会突袭封锁
And the Triarchy fleet will, at any moment,

13:00.690 --> 13:02.740
他们的兵力是海蛇的三倍
ambush the blockade with a force thrice the Sea Snake's strength.

13:07.950 --> 13:09.740
我们只需要等待时机
We only need to bide our time.

14:45.550 --> 14:47.590
兰尼斯特的大军已被击溃 王子殿下
The Lannister host has scattered, my prince.

14:47.670 --> 14:50.300
先锋部队被打散 后卫部队四分五裂 落荒而逃
The vanguard was smashed and the rearguard broken and fled.

14:54.510 --> 14:56.640
金光闪闪的兰尼斯特大人呢
And what of the golden Lord Lannister?

14:57.390 --> 14:59.100
当骑兵阵型溃散时 他就逃跑了
Fled when the cavalry broke rank.

14:59.520 --> 15:02.190
我们的斥侯推测 他们会在诸神之眼附近重新集结
Our scouts believe they may be regrouping near the God's Eye.

15:02.270 --> 15:05.320
那我们就在那里继续战斗 我们必须把他们赶尽杀绝
Then we'll continue the fight there. We must pursue them till the last.

15:05.440 --> 15:08.570
- 为死者挖好坟墓 - 是 大人
- Have graves dug for our dead. - Aye, my lord.

15:08.690 --> 15:10.910
科拉克休会迅速处理掉这些尸体
Caraxes would make short work of these bodies.

15:11.700 --> 15:13.570
烧掉就不会引发瘟疫
And burnt flesh carries no plague.

15:13.910 --> 15:15.200
那不是我们的传统
That is not our way.

15:16.120 --> 15:18.450
河间地的子民必须入土为安
Rivermen must be returned to the mud.

15:21.420 --> 15:22.420
大人
My lord!

15:29.670 --> 15:31.760
- 全体备战 - 全体备战
To arms!

15:31.840 --> 15:33.050
向我集结
Form on me!

16:43.370 --> 16:47.590
我们来此为龙之女王效忠赴死
We have come to die for the dragon queen.

16:57.720 --> 16:58.720
很好
Very good.

16:59.310 --> 17:01.060
我们还有很多狮子要猎
We've got more lions to hunt.

17:55.900 --> 17:57.320
早安 首相大人
Good morrow, Lord Hand.

18:00.780 --> 18:02.490
有伊蒙德王子的消息吗
Has there been word from Prince Aemond?

18:03.450 --> 18:05.500
没有 目前还没有
None. As yet.

18:07.580 --> 18:10.380
他和瓦格哈尔 本该在鹿角堡和我们会合的
He and Vhagar were supposed to have joined us back at the Antlers.

18:11.790 --> 18:14.510
我们毫无防备地行军
We march ever exposed.

18:14.630 --> 18:16.550
- 如果他不来... - 他非来不可
- If he does not come-- - He has to come.

18:21.390 --> 18:22.850
还有一件事
There is another matter.

18:24.100 --> 18:26.520
我们的人蹂躏了一个村女
One of our men has ravaged a village girl.

18:27.020 --> 18:28.890
我亲眼目睹此暴行
I witnessed the events myself.

18:29.980 --> 18:31.400
必须有所处置
Something must be done.

18:32.690 --> 18:34.730
你要的话可以吊死他
Hang him then, if you wish.

18:35.860 --> 18:38.240
我不是总队长
I am not his Lord Commander.

18:41.240 --> 18:42.950
惩罚的确势在必行
A punishment is due, yes,

18:43.660 --> 18:46.620
但我们也必须向弟兄表明
but also a statement to the men.

18:47.250 --> 18:51.130
我们不是野兽 而是拥有荣誉的骑士与士兵
That we are not beasts, but knights, and soldiers of honor.

18:51.250 --> 18:52.960
看看你的四周 加尔温爵士
Look around you, Ser Gwayne.

18:56.090 --> 18:57.300
看看天空
Look to the sky.

18:58.340 --> 18:59.510
看看地平线
To the horizon.

19:00.720 --> 19:02.470
末日与毁灭已将我们包围
Doom and ruin surround us.

19:05.310 --> 19:07.430
在走向终结之前 我们都将沦为野兽
We will all become beasts before our end.

19:08.270 --> 19:10.230
除非我们抛弃自己的原则
Only if we abandon our principles.

19:18.780 --> 19:20.110
我从没见过我母亲
Never knew my mother.

19:23.200 --> 19:25.280
和大部分贫民窟的贱民一样
Same as most of the gutter-rats.

19:30.210 --> 19:32.790
活得比杂种狗还不如 天天被人踹
Was kicked about more than a mongrel dog.

19:39.170 --> 19:42.050
我渴望死亡的日子 远比求生的念头来得多
Wished for death more days than I wished to live.

19:47.600 --> 19:50.560
但有个来自埃索斯的红袍僧
There was this priest from Essos.

19:52.480 --> 19:53.560
他对我有意思
He fancied me.

19:54.690 --> 19:55.820
付我钱
Paid me coin.

20:00.440 --> 20:01.610
要我做些事
To do things.

20:06.530 --> 20:08.410
他说我身上流有国王的血脉
He said I had king's blood.

20:09.040 --> 20:11.120
说我生来就肩负使命
That I was born for a purpose.

20:13.540 --> 20:15.000
我喜欢那个故事
I liked that story.

20:16.790 --> 20:17.960
所以我欣然接受了
So I owned it.

20:20.210 --> 20:21.840
龙种乌尔夫
Ulf the Dragonseed.

20:26.970 --> 20:29.010
结果那个红婊子没说错
And that red cunt was right.

20:33.190 --> 20:34.480
你呢
And you?

20:34.900 --> 20:36.860
你身上的龙之血脉是哪来的
Where'd you get your dragon's blood?

20:43.450 --> 20:44.450
你有听到什么声音吗
Did you hear something?

20:47.830 --> 20:49.450
我不喜欢这个地方
Don't like this place.

20:49.740 --> 20:51.200
整天只能干等
All this hanging about.

20:51.790 --> 20:53.660
瓦格哈尔早该到了
Vhagar was supposed to be here already.

20:53.750 --> 20:55.210
我们得等它来
We have to wait until she comes.

20:55.290 --> 20:57.130
女王可没说要等
The queen didn't say nothing about waiting.

20:57.250 --> 20:59.500
她说“去那里杀了伊蒙德”
She said, come here, kill Aemond.

20:59.960 --> 21:02.090
我可一点都不期待见到瓦格哈尔
I wouldn't be too keen to meet Vhagar.

21:02.210 --> 21:04.800
它和独眼至少杀了两条龙
She and the One-Eye have slain at least two dragons already.

21:04.880 --> 21:06.300
但为了城堡
Fight'll be worth it, though.

21:07.680 --> 21:08.850
这样的战斗是值得的
For the castle.

21:09.970 --> 21:10.970
什么城堡
What castle?

21:11.850 --> 21:14.600
女王答应封我们为骑士
The queen promised to make us knights,

21:14.890 --> 21:16.850
所以我们会获封城堡
so we get a castle.

21:24.650 --> 21:26.820
- 怎么了  - 你必须被任命为领主
- What? - You have to be named a lord

21:26.950 --> 21:28.030
才会获封城堡
to get a castle.

21:28.160 --> 21:29.950
- 那骑士会得到什么  - 一匹马
- What's a knight get, then? - A horse.

21:30.030 --> 21:32.910
我要一匹该死的马做什么  我已经有一条龙了
What do I need with a fucking horse?

21:33.000 --> 21:34.580
你会被封为乌尔夫爵士
- I've got a dragon. - You'd be Ser Ulf,

21:34.660 --> 21:36.540
人们必须对你表示敬意
and men would have to show you respect.

21:36.620 --> 21:40.710
人们得对我恭恭敬敬 是因为我他妈的有只巨龙
Men would have to show me respect 'cause of the big fucking dragon.

21:42.380 --> 21:44.010
头衔又不能当饭吃
I can't live in a title.

21:44.720 --> 21:45.930
也不能当酒喝
Or drink it.

21:50.640 --> 21:52.310
我认为会有女人投怀送抱
I imagine there'd be eager women.

21:54.430 --> 21:56.390
有了城堡 女人要多少有多少
Get more women with a castle.

22:31.470 --> 22:34.010
听话 偷羊贼

22:35.890 --> 22:39.140
我们必须去龙石岛

22:40.060 --> 22:41.190
回家吧

23:02.330 --> 23:04.630
你知道伊耿逃走了吗
Did you know Aegon had fled?

23:09.010 --> 23:10.130
他应该要在这里的
He was meant to be here.

23:11.760 --> 23:13.510
伊蒙德才应该要飞走
It's Aemond who should have flown.

23:14.760 --> 23:15.930
你在害怕
You're frightened.

23:19.730 --> 23:22.440
克里斯顿和加尔温爵士身陷险境
Ser Criston and Ser Gwayne are in great peril.

23:23.270 --> 23:24.860
我只是担心我们的骑士
I fear only for our knights.

23:26.940 --> 23:28.320
伊蒙德应该跟他们一起作战
Aemond should be with them.

23:28.400 --> 23:30.070
伊蒙德也很害怕
Aemond's frightened, too.

23:32.360 --> 23:35.990
他驯服瓦格哈尔之后 便忘了恐惧为何物
After he claimed Vhagar, he forgot what fear was.

23:36.740 --> 23:38.120
但他现在想起来了
But he remembers now.

23:39.750 --> 23:42.750
他很清楚 面对雷妮拉的龙群 他必死无疑
He knows that if he has to face Rhaenyra's dragons, he'll die.

23:52.300 --> 23:53.640
索伦爵士
Ser Soren?

23:58.930 --> 24:01.640
欧尔蒙大人率领海塔尔家的大军前来
Lord Ormund marches here with the Hightower host.

24:01.770 --> 24:04.980
派出你最快的骑士 尽快把这个交给他
Dispatch one of your fastest riders and deliver this to him with haste.

24:05.770 --> 24:07.320
这是国王的指示
These are the king's instructions.

24:07.400 --> 24:08.570
国王的
The king's?

24:10.400 --> 24:11.780
尽快 索伦爵士
With haste, Ser Soren.

24:11.900 --> 24:13.160
马上办 皇后陛下
At once, Your Grace.

24:16.370 --> 24:17.790
艾伦 坐下
Alyn, sit.

24:37.220 --> 24:38.390
我特地留了这瓶
I saved this one.

24:40.930 --> 24:42.350
从伊班岛来的
It's from Ib.

24:43.270 --> 24:45.270
我喝太浪费了
Such luxury is wasted on me.

24:47.730 --> 24:49.570
酒已经开了
I've already broken the wax.

24:52.110 --> 24:54.280
我可没打算
And I am not prepared...

24:57.530 --> 24:58.950
一人独饮
to drink alone.

25:15.470 --> 25:18.680
我忘了他们给它取了什么 古怪难读的名字
I forget the guttural name they have for it.

25:20.010 --> 25:23.430
但我知道粗略翻译过来 意思就是“龙之水”
But I believe a rough interpretation is "dragon water."

25:25.480 --> 25:26.940
也许多喝几次就习惯了
An acquired taste, perhaps.

25:29.520 --> 25:30.980
女王传话来了
The queen has sent word.

25:32.190 --> 25:34.030
我们要从封锁撤走五艘船
We are to pull five ships from the blockade,

25:34.150 --> 25:37.410
顺着黑水河而下 占领君临的港口
sail down the Blackwater, and seize King's Landing's port.

25:37.490 --> 25:38.700
她要占领君临
She's taking King's Landing?

25:38.820 --> 25:40.740
现在雷妮拉占了绝对优势
Rhaenyra's advantage is now absolute.

25:40.830 --> 25:43.700
她会派她的龙包围君临
She will surround the city with her dragons

25:43.830 --> 25:46.080
逼伊耿与伊蒙德投降
and force the surrender of Aegon and Aemond.

25:47.250 --> 25:49.790
我承认我对这个敌人所知甚少
I admit I know little of this enemy.

25:50.710 --> 25:53.510
但独眼伊蒙德似乎是 那种宁可让一切付之一炬
But Aemond One-Eye seems the sort

25:53.630 --> 25:55.090
也不愿放弃王位的人
who would sooner let it all burn than abandon the throne.

25:57.340 --> 25:58.840
前方有惊涛骇浪
Rough seas lie ahead.

26:12.400 --> 26:15.690
我无法完全修复
I cannot fully mend...

26:16.700 --> 26:20.820
我们之间的裂痕
the breach between us.

26:22.330 --> 26:24.790
但我接受这是我的过错
But I do accept that it was of my making.

26:29.830 --> 26:31.130
我很喜欢你母亲
I was fond of your mother.

26:33.300 --> 26:34.300
无论我们当时...
For...

26:35.550 --> 26:37.090
曾拥有过什么
whatever we had together.

26:41.390 --> 26:43.560
我曾试着为你和你哥哥
I did try to provide a life for you.

26:45.060 --> 26:46.350
提供安稳的生活
For your brother.

26:46.480 --> 26:48.730
安稳的生活 或许吧
A life, perhaps.

26:48.810 --> 26:50.020
但从未给过名分
But never a name.

26:58.570 --> 27:00.030
我对此感到抱歉
I am sorry for it.

27:01.870 --> 27:03.740
前方有船
Sail ho!

27:03.830 --> 27:05.240
朝我们过来了

27:24.300 --> 27:26.390
发现敌舰
Enemy ships sighted!

27:28.930 --> 27:30.980
弓箭手前往桅顶就位

27:31.100 --> 27:33.230
径直朝东北方向前进

27:33.400 --> 27:34.650
发现敌舰
Enemy ships sighted.

27:34.770 --> 27:37.280
- 他们有多少兵力  - 目前已清点出53艘
- What is their strength? - Three-and-fifty counted so far.

27:37.400 --> 27:39.110
他们的船数已经超过我们了
They already outnumber us.

27:40.200 --> 27:43.570
放下船桨 派渡鸦去龙石岛报信
Put the oars out. Send ravens to Dragonstone.

27:43.700 --> 27:44.990
放下船桨
Put the oars out!

27:45.120 --> 27:48.870
航向封锁前方 通知舰队形成战线
Take us to the head of the blockade and signal the fleet: form battle lines.

27:49.120 --> 27:50.870
来的是兰尼斯特家 还是葛雷乔伊家的人
Is it the Lannisters or the Greyjoys?

27:52.000 --> 27:53.170
是三女儿王国
It's the Triarchy.

27:55.880 --> 27:56.880
把我的盔甲拿来
Bring my armor.

28:20.780 --> 28:21.860
司令
Commander.

28:23.740 --> 28:26.330
喉道有三个通往黑水河的入口
The Gullet has three inlets into the Blackwater,

28:26.450 --> 28:29.750
其中最大的一个 就在潮头岛的正南方
the largest of which opens just to the south of Driftmark.

28:29.870 --> 28:33.210
但我坚信 我们必须向南方的入口推进
But I hold strongly that we must press towards the southern inlet.

28:33.710 --> 28:36.750
如果我们的舰队 与瓦列利安的舰队短兵相接
If our armada engages the Velaryon fleet at close combat,

28:36.880 --> 28:39.090
就能削弱雷妮拉的龙群的威胁
it will blunt the threat of Rhaenyra's dragons.

28:39.170 --> 28:41.300
他们不会愿意烧毁自己的战舰
They will be loath to burn their own ships.

28:41.420 --> 28:43.010
聪明的策略 大人
A canny strategy, my lord.

28:43.970 --> 28:46.970
难怪你的国王会任命你为海政大臣
I can see why your king made you Lord of the Ships.

28:49.970 --> 28:52.390
如果你最后落海 你会后悔穿成这样
You'll rule all this kit if you wind up in the drink.

28:54.440 --> 28:57.730
我的策略非常明确 就是不要落海
My strategy is expressly not to "end up in the drink."

29:00.480 --> 29:03.780
在我们落海前 会先在甲板上分出胜负
We will face death on this deck before we face it in the sea.

29:04.400 --> 29:06.660
当战斗开始时 你会庆幸有穿盔甲的
You will be glad of our armor when the fighting starts.

29:06.780 --> 29:07.990
我知道我会
I know I will.

29:08.120 --> 29:11.120
海蛇的斥侯发出警报了 司令
The Sea Snake scouts have raised the alarm, Commander.

29:12.410 --> 29:14.250
真想看看他的脸
If only to see his face.

29:15.790 --> 29:19.590
示意哈夫贾率领麾下分队 突破北方隘口
Signal Halfjaw to take his detachment and penetrate the northern pass.

29:20.210 --> 29:23.260
北方隘口在龙石岛北边 是最远的路线
The northern pass is the farthest route

29:23.380 --> 29:24.590
要去那做什么
running north of Dragonstone. Whatever for?

29:25.220 --> 29:26.340
打劫高潮城
To sack High Tide.

29:27.760 --> 29:29.100
科利斯大人的城堡
Lord Corlys' castle?

29:30.850 --> 29:33.180
我们需要你所有舰队的战力 如果要...
We will require the full strength of your fleet if we have any hope--

29:33.310 --> 29:36.520
高潮城是海蛇的大本营
High Tide is a monument to the Sea Snake himself.

29:38.770 --> 29:42.530
当他看到他的藏宝库陷入火海时 还能保持专注吗
Do you think his focus will hold when he sees his treasure room aflame?

31:05.650 --> 31:07.990
大胆琼恩 今日天候如何
What is the weather to be today, Bold Jon?

31:08.110 --> 31:10.990
根据信使那难看的脸色 看来接下来要倒大楣了
Raining piss or shit, from the looks of the messenger.

31:13.030 --> 31:14.200
早安 爵士
Good morrow, ser.

31:15.580 --> 31:17.870
- 有什么消息  - 早安 海塔尔大人
- What news? - Good morrow, my Lord Hightower.

31:20.500 --> 31:22.380
我带来伊蒙德国王的紧急口信
I bring urgent word from King Aemond.

31:22.710 --> 31:24.040
他现在是国王了
King, is he now?

31:54.950 --> 31:58.290
伊蒙德说我们要在这里扎营 等待进一步消息
Aemond says we have to make camp here and await further word.

31:59.290 --> 32:01.540
他三天后就会加入我们
He shall join us in three days' time.

32:07.670 --> 32:09.010
所以伊耿死了
So Aegon's dead, then?

32:13.680 --> 32:15.550
哪个国王当政都一样
One king is as good as another.

32:16.850 --> 32:19.930
带这个弟兄去洗个澡 饱餐一顿 给他安排个像样的营帐
Have this lad bathed and fed. Give him a good tent.

32:20.060 --> 32:21.310
是 爵士
Yes, sire.

32:25.360 --> 32:27.940
也许好天气会持续下去
Mayhaps the weather will hold.

32:33.660 --> 32:36.530
我们会落到这步田地都是我的错
It is my fault we're in this position.

32:46.880 --> 32:50.260
我竭尽全力将伊耿推上王座 但我...
I strove tirelessly to put Aegon on the throne, but I...

32:52.510 --> 32:54.470
我却没能教会他如何治理国家
I failed to prepare him to rule.

32:59.010 --> 33:00.850
他的软弱是他咎由自取
His frailties are his own.

33:06.810 --> 33:08.400
应该由你来统治的
You should have been king.

33:12.650 --> 33:16.820
如果你先出生 也许我们就不会沦落至此 但是...
If you'd only been born first, then perhaps we wouldn't be here, but...

33:18.580 --> 33:20.580
我们只能根据当下的局势做出判断
we must ever play the board before us.

33:31.090 --> 33:32.090
这就是为什么
That is why

33:32.840 --> 33:35.550
你必须去赫伦堡
you need to go to Harrenhal.

33:40.720 --> 33:41.850
去那里做什么
To what end?

33:42.390 --> 33:43.730
那里是要塞
It is a stronghold.

33:44.940 --> 33:47.480
曾经抵挡过龙焰的要塞
One that has withstood dragonfire once before.

33:48.100 --> 33:50.860
你在君临已经不安全了
You are no longer safe here in King's Landing.

33:58.570 --> 34:00.200
害怕是正常的
It is well to be fearful.

34:00.950 --> 34:02.540
我也很害怕
I, too, am afraid.

34:05.790 --> 34:07.170
我不害怕
I'm not afraid.

34:14.800 --> 34:15.920
你当然不怕
Of course not.

34:16.840 --> 34:18.430
但你现在是国王了
But you are the crown now.

34:20.470 --> 34:23.140
雷妮拉会派新的龙来杀你
And Rhaenyra will send her new dragons here for you.

34:23.680 --> 34:24.930
迟早都会
Soon or late.

34:28.650 --> 34:30.230
我不怕
I am not afraid.

34:35.940 --> 34:37.360
飞去河间地
Fly to the Riverlands.

34:37.990 --> 34:39.240
把戴蒙引出来
Draw Daemon out.

34:40.280 --> 34:43.540
他身边只有一只龙 杀了他对雷妮拉会是一大打击
He has just one dragon, and killing him would be a vicious blow to Rhaenyra.

34:45.700 --> 34:48.370
到了赫伦堡 你就无法被攻破了
At Harrenhal, you will be unassailable.

34:53.170 --> 34:54.840
也许我可以在那里跟你碰面
Perhaps I could even meet you there.

34:57.670 --> 34:59.380
飞去那里前路未明
That road is uncertain.

35:01.180 --> 35:02.220
但留在此处
But this one,

35:03.050 --> 35:06.020
如果你留在这里 等雷妮拉和她的龙过来
if you stay here and wait for Rhaenyra

35:06.140 --> 35:07.680
命数就已成定局
and her dragons to come, this one is certain.

35:12.770 --> 35:14.400
你好勇敢
You are so courageous.

35:16.820 --> 35:19.030
但我不能像失去伊耿那样失去你
But I cannot lose you as I did Aegon.

35:21.450 --> 35:23.160
如果我失去你 我将不知所措
If I do, I will be lost.

35:26.330 --> 35:28.750
听我的话 伊蒙德 拜托了
Heed me, Aemond, please.

36:07.160 --> 36:09.830
我会在黑心赫伦的厅堂
I shall host a feast there in your honor.

36:10.750 --> 36:12.420
为你举办一场盛宴
In Black Harren's hall

36:13.790 --> 36:16.170
将我叔叔的首级插在长矛上
whilst my uncle's head looks down from a spike.

36:47.620 --> 36:50.580
要是伊蒙德发现我们要伏击他呢
What if Aemond knew we were coming for him?

36:51.370 --> 36:53.710
他大可趁我们不在时攻击龙石岛
He could have attacked Dragonstone in our absence.

36:54.460 --> 36:56.170
女王指派任务给我们
Queen assigned us a task.

36:56.290 --> 36:57.960
我们必须执行到底
We must man it steadfastly.

36:58.800 --> 37:01.340
如果敌人就指望这个呢
And if that is what the enemy is counting upon?

37:12.140 --> 37:14.020
- 那是什么  - 去他的鬼地方
- What is that? - Fuck this place!

37:14.100 --> 37:16.560
- 怎么回事  - 我要走了 就是这样
- What's happened? - I'm leaving is what's happened.

37:16.650 --> 37:18.060
我们必须等瓦格哈尔
We must wait for Vhagar.

37:18.190 --> 37:20.690
等多久 等到永远吗
For how long? Forever and a day?

37:20.940 --> 37:22.650
它要来早就来了
She was meant to be here already.

37:24.320 --> 37:26.280
女王只指示我们伏击瓦格哈尔
The queen only instructed us to ambush Vhagar.

37:26.360 --> 37:27.990
她没说如果瓦格哈尔没来该怎么办
She did not say what to do if the dragon never came.

37:28.120 --> 37:29.620
我说我们该留下来
I say we remain.

37:29.740 --> 37:31.660
谁他妈让你当国王了
Who made you fucking king?

37:31.790 --> 37:32.910
我不喜欢这里
I don't like it here.

37:33.000 --> 37:34.660
你要这样向女王陛下交代吗
Is that what you'll tell Her Grace?

37:34.750 --> 37:35.830
说你是个懦夫
That you're craven?

37:35.920 --> 37:37.210
我会如实告诉女王陛下
I'll tell Her Grace true.

37:37.830 --> 37:40.840
说我们站岗 瓦格哈尔根本没出现
That we stood watch and Vhagar never came.

37:40.920 --> 37:42.420
你朋友说得没错
Your friend's right.

37:46.890 --> 37:48.550
你们错过战争了
You're missing the battle.

37:48.680 --> 37:50.810
女王需要你们去龙石岛
The queen needs you at Dragonstone.

37:53.560 --> 37:56.560
- 你是谁  - 我是女巫
- Who are you? - I'm a witch.

38:01.940 --> 38:03.780
好了 请多保重
Right. Look after yourselves.

38:16.160 --> 38:18.080
戴蒙离君临还有十天的路程

38:18.170 --> 38:20.790
- 至少他会及时赶到 - 陛下
Your Grace!

38:21.290 --> 38:24.460
- 喉道正在交战 - 跟谁交战
- There is war in the Gullet. - Who?

38:24.550 --> 38:27.680
一支自东方旭日航行而来的舰队
An armada of ships sailing out of the rising sun from the east.

38:27.800 --> 38:29.180
敌人发动埋伏了
They have sprung their trap.

38:35.180 --> 38:36.180
我去看看
I shall go.

38:44.110 --> 38:45.110
母亲
Mother!

38:45.990 --> 38:47.570
停下 你不能去
Stop! You cannot!

38:47.700 --> 38:50.280
你要说的话我都听过了
There is nothing you can say that I have not heard.

38:50.410 --> 38:51.740
如果你死了...
If you die...

38:52.370 --> 38:54.200
那你终于可以当国王了
Then you will at last be king.

38:56.660 --> 38:57.830
拿我的骑乘皮甲来
My riding leathers.

39:06.300 --> 39:09.050
你必须把这扇门闩上并上锁
You are to lock and bar this door.

39:09.680 --> 39:12.430
必须限制女王的行动 直到她恢复理智
The queen must be confined until she regains her senses.

39:12.550 --> 39:14.510
我不能违抗女王陛下的命令
I could not defy Her Grace's commands.

39:14.640 --> 39:18.180
你是女王铁卫的骑士 洛伦特爵士
You are a knight of the Queensguard, Ser Lorent.

39:19.100 --> 39:22.400
你发誓要保护女王陛下 不受任何威胁
You swore to protect Her Grace from all threats.

39:23.650 --> 39:24.980
包括她自己
Including herself.

39:30.780 --> 39:31.820
用你的命...
Your life...

39:33.280 --> 39:34.330
换她的命
for hers.

39:43.170 --> 39:47.340
小杰 快收回成命 这是叛国
Jace. Rescind your command. It is treason.

39:47.420 --> 39:50.130
她拒绝了我的建言 并千方百计阻止我参战
She has rejected my counsel, my every attempt to join the fight.

39:50.220 --> 39:52.260
所以你反而对她宣战
So you make war with her instead?

39:52.590 --> 39:54.930
如果这是另一场伏击行动 就像鸦栖堡战役一样呢
This is all the work of an ambush, like Rook's Rest,

39:55.010 --> 39:56.970
如果这只是引女王过去的诡计呢
a ruse to draw out the queen herself.

39:57.560 --> 40:00.350
他们杀了我弟弟 贝妮拉
They killed my brother, Baela.

40:01.100 --> 40:02.980
我不会让他们也夺走她
I won't let them take her as well.

40:10.530 --> 40:11.820
跟我一起去
Come with me.

40:13.700 --> 40:15.490
我们准备好了
We are ready.

40:17.160 --> 40:19.080
我们可以为她拿下这场胜利
We can win this victory for her.

40:20.370 --> 40:22.670
这不一直都是我们的目标吗
Was this not always our purpose?

40:47.610 --> 40:49.900
洛伦特爵士 开门
Ser Lorent, open the door.

40:50.030 --> 40:52.900
女王陛下 这是杰西里斯王子的命令
Your Grace, it was the Prince Jacaerys' command.

40:53.660 --> 40:54.990
为了确保您的安全
To ensure your safety.

40:55.620 --> 40:57.080
他妈的快开门
Open the fucking door.

40:57.200 --> 40:58.200
我办不到
I cannot.

40:59.240 --> 41:00.290
洛伦特爵士
Ser Lorent!

41:02.540 --> 41:03.540
小杰
Jace!

41:07.130 --> 41:08.800
快给我开门
You open the fucking door!

41:10.340 --> 41:12.050
马上放我出去
You release me at once!

41:12.170 --> 41:14.380
我会让你们人头落地
I will have your heads for this!

41:43.120 --> 41:45.290
弩弓手 预备
Crossbows, ready!

41:45.370 --> 41:48.420
- 放箭 停 放箭 - 弓箭手
Release!

41:48.500 --> 41:49.590
预备
Archers, ready!

41:50.290 --> 41:51.420
放箭
Release!

41:52.260 --> 41:54.090
弓箭手 预备
Archers, ready!

41:54.670 --> 41:55.930
放箭
Release!

41:56.050 --> 41:58.430
瞭望兵 向舰队发出讯号
Barrelman! Signal the fleet:

41:58.550 --> 42:00.140
不要集结
Do not cluster.

42:00.260 --> 42:02.430
- 让他们继续追 - 遵命
Keep them on the chase.

42:02.560 --> 42:04.890
- 交给你们了 - 弓箭手 预备
- Aye-aye! - The fight is yours.

42:04.980 --> 42:05.980
弓箭手
Archers, ready!

42:06.560 --> 42:08.230
- 快  - 放箭
- Archers, go! - Loose!

42:08.350 --> 42:10.020
看到指挥舰了 大人
Flagship's been sighted, m'lord.

42:11.230 --> 42:13.150
- 是悍妇铁拳号 - 洛哈
- It's the Bitchfist. - Lohar?

42:13.780 --> 42:14.780
预备

42:15.280 --> 42:16.740
- 用力推 - 小心

42:16.820 --> 42:20.120
武装起来 朝它逼近 我要让他们看见我们的踪影
Harden up and make towards her. I want her to sight us.

42:20.660 --> 42:21.990
遵命 大人
Aye, m'lord.

42:22.290 --> 42:24.120
武装起来 加快速度
Harden up! Pick up the stroke!

42:51.270 --> 42:52.730
它来了 各位
Here she comes, lads!

42:53.110 --> 42:54.980
不起眼的宝藏船
Our jewel in the rough.

42:55.570 --> 42:58.910
向舰队发出讯号 海蛇由我们对付
Signal the fleet. The Sea Snake belongs to us.

42:59.030 --> 43:02.030
待我们夺下这艘船 战利品大家平分
An equal share of the plunder when we take the ship!

43:02.160 --> 43:03.790
- 是 司令 - 司令
- Aye, Commander! - Commander!

43:04.740 --> 43:05.750
司令
Commander!

43:06.500 --> 43:08.120
我们要对付的是指挥舰
Ours is the flagship.

43:08.250 --> 43:10.500
我们不能只专注在单一目标上
We cannot give ourselves to a singular pursuit.

43:10.630 --> 43:13.170
我们必须带头进攻 以免阵线崩溃
We must lead the assault lest it fall into disorder.

43:14.630 --> 43:16.420
你以为我航行过狭海
Do you think I sailed across the Narrow Sea

43:16.550 --> 43:18.170
是为了替你的国王赢得战争吗
to win your king's war for him?

43:19.880 --> 43:22.470
合约上就是这么写的
Those were the terms of the contract.

43:23.350 --> 43:25.970
20多年来 海蛇带头
The Sea Snake led the persecution and slaughter

43:26.060 --> 43:28.390
迫害并屠杀我的同伴
of my mates for more than 20 years.

43:29.060 --> 43:30.940
我是为了杀他才与你们合作
I sealed your contract for him.

43:32.360 --> 43:35.860
今晚 我们将踏平高潮城
Tonight, we shall walk in the ashes of High Tide!

43:35.980 --> 43:39.150
当我坐上浮木王座 以海蛇之耳为食
You'll all join me as I sit the Driftwood Throne

43:39.280 --> 43:41.320
你们都将与我一同狂欢
and dine on the Sea Snake's ears!

43:44.370 --> 43:46.490
- 解开船绳  - 划桨就位
Break us free!

43:46.790 --> 43:48.160
追上去
And give chase!

44:03.010 --> 44:04.760
他只是想保护你
He wishes only to protect you.

44:04.890 --> 44:06.810
我从未要求他保护我
I never asked to be protected.

44:18.360 --> 44:20.190
我可以预见御前议会的背叛
I expect it from my council,

44:20.280 --> 44:23.530
那些懦弱的家伙 整天只会畏畏缩缩地抓着自己的外衣
those craven men ever clutching at their doublets.

44:23.660 --> 44:25.200
但我的女王铁卫
But my Queensguard?

44:25.280 --> 44:26.700
我的亲生儿子
Mine own son?

45:19.750 --> 45:22.260
或许我有着女人的娇弱身躯
I may appear to have the weak and feeble body of a woman,

45:22.380 --> 45:24.840
但我拥有国王的意志和精神
but I possess the heart and spirit of a king.

45:28.260 --> 45:29.680
右舷有敌人
Enemy to starboard!

45:29.760 --> 45:32.350
- 散开... - 弩炮 重新装填
- Split, split, split! - Ballistae, reload!

45:32.480 --> 45:33.980
把火扑灭
And put those fires out!

45:36.310 --> 45:37.730
舰队被包围了
The fleet is surrounded.

45:38.060 --> 45:40.230
悍妇铁拳号现在派一小支分队 来追我们
And the Bitchfist now pursues us with a small detachment.

45:40.360 --> 45:41.730
- 有龙  - 有龙
- Dragon! - Dragon!

45:41.820 --> 45:43.190
有龙
Dragon!

46:13.930 --> 46:16.190
设定通过龙石岛隘口的航线
Set a course through the Dragonstone Pass.

46:17.900 --> 46:20.440
快要退潮了 我们会搁浅的
The tide is nearly out. We'll run aground.

46:21.570 --> 46:23.280
洛哈只想对付我
Lohar only wants me.

46:23.820 --> 46:24.820
她会跟上来的
She'll follow.

46:25.740 --> 46:28.320
没有她 他们的舰队就无人掌舵
Without her, their fleet will be rudderless...

46:28.990 --> 46:30.910
沦为我们龙群的猎物
and easy prey for our dragons.

46:33.870 --> 46:37.250
- 向右转舵  - 准备战斗 各位
- Starboard on our helm! - Fight ready, men!

46:37.750 --> 46:39.420
把钩索拿来
Bring the grapnels!

46:40.250 --> 46:41.420
- 上 - 前进

46:46.590 --> 46:48.090
- 就位 - 预备
- Ready? - Ready!

46:48.220 --> 46:49.220
船长

46:51.100 --> 46:52.100
净空

46:53.640 --> 46:54.850
装填
Load!

47:18.540 --> 47:21.130
稳住 沃马克斯 冷静

47:25.340 --> 47:28.220
叫我屠龙者洛哈
Call me Lohar, Dragon-Slayer!

47:28.970 --> 47:30.300
继续追击
Press the pursuit!

47:30.720 --> 47:32.050
往上 沃马克斯

47:32.180 --> 47:33.390
继续飞

47:46.860 --> 47:49.030
去吧 月舞 去支援

48:33.570 --> 48:35.990
松开帆索 放下船桨
Ease the sheets and put out the oars.

48:36.450 --> 48:37.950
抛出测深绳
Cast the leadlines.

48:38.080 --> 48:39.500
收帆
Clew up the course.

48:40.750 --> 48:42.540
测深员 前往测深位置
Leadsmen, to the channels.

48:42.620 --> 48:44.330
抛出测深绳
Cast the leadline!

48:46.630 --> 48:47.670
划

48:58.060 --> 49:00.640
水深6?
Depth, six fathoms!

49:00.720 --> 49:02.310
瞭望兵 回报
Barrelman, report!

49:02.940 --> 49:06.980
正前方有碎浪 潮水正急剧退去
Breakers dead ahead. Tide's running hard out.

49:07.110 --> 49:09.610
暗流正强力将我们推向左舷方向
Currents are strong set to larboard.

49:14.160 --> 49:17.740
三艘敌舰从后方快速接近
Three enemy ships closing fast astern!

49:18.780 --> 49:19.950
向左打舵
Larboard your helm.

49:21.790 --> 49:23.160
听好我的指示
Follow my direction closely.

49:23.790 --> 49:26.540
有一条路能通过隘口 但非常狭窄
There is a way through the pass, but it is narrow.

49:27.500 --> 49:30.460
水深5?半 还在急速变浅
Depth: half-five and fast receding!

49:32.670 --> 49:35.050
- 七  - 速度 七节
- Seven! - Speed: seven knots!

49:35.130 --> 49:36.340
稍微向左转舵
Slight to larboard.

49:36.470 --> 49:37.930
是 司令大人
Aye, Lord Admiral.

49:38.760 --> 49:39.890
跟着它的尾浪走
Follow her wake.

49:40.430 --> 49:41.930
我们不能再往前了
We must go no further.

49:42.060 --> 49:44.060
隘口水太浅了
The pass is too shallow.

49:45.640 --> 49:47.650
我们对这个地方一无所知
We do not know the lay of this place.

49:48.860 --> 49:50.190
我们等于是瞎子摸象
We are sailing blind.

49:50.270 --> 49:51.610
跟着海蛇就行
The Sea Snake will guide us.

49:58.280 --> 50:00.870
- 水深4?1呎 - 4?1呎
- One over four! - One over four!

50:00.990 --> 50:03.500
距离大约70码
Perhaps 70 yards' distance.

50:03.790 --> 50:04.790
慢慢来
Easy now.

50:05.410 --> 50:06.750
往右转舵
Starboard your helm.

50:10.630 --> 50:12.550
太多了 轻轻转回来
Too strong. Ease it back.

50:16.300 --> 50:18.510
- 报深度 - 水深4?少2呎

50:19.930 --> 50:20.930
让我来
Let me.

50:21.810 --> 50:24.230
- 水深4?少2呎 - 现在距离剩40码
Forty yards now.

50:25.890 --> 50:27.100
35码
Thirty-five!

50:27.690 --> 50:30.400
- 水深3?半  - 水深3?半
- And a half-three! - And a half-three!

50:30.810 --> 50:32.320
收桨
Bank the oars.

50:32.440 --> 50:34.650
舵手听令 收桨
Coxswain ahoy! Bank oars!

50:34.780 --> 50:36.070
收桨

50:36.200 --> 50:37.570
给他们一点时间

50:40.870 --> 50:43.490
- 25码 - 25码
- Twenty-five yards! - Twenty-five yards!

50:44.200 --> 50:45.910
- 水深3?1呎 - 3?1呎
- One over three! - Ten yards!

50:46.000 --> 50:47.540
- 10码 - 10码
- Ten yards! - We're over the Teeth!

50:47.670 --> 50:48.960
我们通过尖石礁了

51:11.150 --> 51:12.230
安全通过了
We're clear!

51:21.200 --> 51:22.740
让尖石礁解决洛哈
Leave Lohar to the Teeth.

51:23.450 --> 51:26.580
返回喉道 我们必须重新加入战斗
Take us back to the Gullet. We must rejoin the fight.

51:47.560 --> 51:49.140
我们到家了

51:57.570 --> 51:59.070
去吧 偷羊贼

51:59.900 --> 52:00.900
去帮忙

52:04.370 --> 52:06.160
立刻派三个人去右舷
Three hands to starboard, now!

52:06.290 --> 52:09.040
- 派三个人去右舷 - 我们要搁浅了
- Three hands to starboard! - We're going to wreck!

52:16.210 --> 52:19.420
我们直接走进他的陷阱了
We have walked directly into his snare.

52:19.550 --> 52:21.760
两人往左舷 稳住船身
Two hands to larboard now and hold her there!

52:21.880 --> 52:24.550
- 两人到左舷 稳住 - 切断锚
- Two hands to larboard, hold! - Cut the anchors!

52:24.680 --> 52:26.680
减轻重量 减少吃水量 快点
Drop weight and raise our draft. Quickly!

52:26.810 --> 52:28.430
- 是 司令  - 帮帮他们
Aye, Commander!

52:28.560 --> 52:29.770
切断锚
Cut the anchors!

52:34.900 --> 52:36.860
你的盔甲有多重
What do you weigh in that armor?

52:40.440 --> 52:41.990
把其他人也解决了
And the rest of them!

52:42.110 --> 52:45.700
稳住阵脚 把该死的船桨收回来
Hold that line, and pull the fucking oars in!

53:04.050 --> 53:07.260
放下船桨 拉近距离 准备好钩索与缆绳
Oars out and close the distance! Bring the hooks and lines!

53:07.850 --> 53:12.020
敌方指挥舰通过了 它从后方快速接近中
Enemy flagship is clear. She's closing fast astern.

53:12.140 --> 53:14.650
- 快走 快走  - 它的速度比我们快
She has the legs on us. We can't outrun her.

53:14.730 --> 53:17.900
我们甩不掉它 而且目前的风势 也不足以让我们逆流而上
And we've not yet the wind to carry us against the current.

53:19.480 --> 53:22.990
收起船帆 放下船桨 向右急转舵
Furl the sails and put the oars out. Hard round to starboard.

53:23.110 --> 53:25.280
准备发动攻势 进行侧舷猛攻
Ready the offensive for a broadside assault.

53:25.410 --> 53:27.990
所有盾兵和弩弓手 各就各位
All shields and crossbows, to your stations!

53:28.450 --> 53:29.740
装填弩炮
Load the ballistae!

53:38.960 --> 53:40.130
登舰部队
Boarding party!

53:40.630 --> 53:42.130
登舰部队
Boarding party.

53:45.260 --> 53:48.430
用力划 别松懈 抵抗水流
Hard about and keep pulling! Strong against the current.

53:48.510 --> 53:50.850
- 划  - 否则船会被暗流拖回尖石礁
- Turn! - Or she'll be dragged back into the Teeth.

54:05.320 --> 54:06.820
船没有转向
She's not turning!

54:11.330 --> 54:13.450
所有盾兵和弩弓手前往右舷
All shields and crossbows to starboard!

54:14.750 --> 54:16.210
侧舷准备
Broadside, ready!

54:19.380 --> 54:22.420
就位 前进 就位
Positions, move! Positions!

54:31.680 --> 54:32.890
弩弓手准备
Crossbows, ready!

54:33.020 --> 54:34.600
- 预备  - 攻击
- Ready! - Strike!

54:39.310 --> 54:42.610
坚持航向 继续划桨
Hold that course and fucking row!

54:44.990 --> 54:47.320
做好冲击准备 保持戒备
Brace and be ready!

54:47.450 --> 54:49.070
就是现在 攻击
Now, strike!

55:02.040 --> 55:03.340
占领敌舰
Take the ship.

55:06.880 --> 55:08.880
动起来 各就各位
On your feet! Prepare to engage!

55:39.080 --> 55:40.080
诸神啊

55:40.540 --> 55:42.290
把驭龙骑士射下来
Bring down the rider!

55:47.800 --> 55:48.800
不

55:49.300 --> 55:50.300
回避

55:50.970 --> 55:52.180
往上

55:52.550 --> 55:53.680
听话

56:00.730 --> 56:02.270
不...偷羊贼

56:02.350 --> 56:03.440
不

56:03.520 --> 56:05.230
- 不  - 有龙 有龙

56:05.320 --> 56:06.530
不

56:06.940 --> 56:09.150
他们不是敌人

57:17.680 --> 57:19.350
追上去 月舞

57:41.330 --> 57:43.750
不 偷羊贼

57:44.500 --> 57:45.790
冷静

57:45.920 --> 57:47.130
服从我

57:49.800 --> 57:50.920
攻击

57:59.180 --> 58:00.350
回避

58:10.480 --> 58:11.530
上啊 沃马克斯

58:12.230 --> 58:13.740
保护月舞

58:19.780 --> 58:23.370
不 不 偷羊贼
No! No! Sheepstealer,

58:23.500 --> 58:24.500
不
no!

58:24.620 --> 58:26.210
听话

58:28.630 --> 58:30.250
那是我姐姐
That's my sister.

59:48.120 --> 59:49.540
父亲
Father!

01:00:05.510 --> 01:00:06.850
撑住 贝妮拉
Hold on, Baela!

01:00:10.100 --> 01:00:12.310
杀了驭龙骑士 沃马克斯

01:00:13.770 --> 01:00:15.020
雷妮亚
Rhaena!

01:00:15.150 --> 01:00:16.440
不 沃马克斯

01:00:16.570 --> 01:00:18.650
转向 转向

01:00:22.240 --> 01:00:24.240
不 偷羊贼
Sheepstealer!

01:00:31.580 --> 01:00:32.670
不

01:00:38.260 --> 01:00:39.300
偷羊贼
Sheepstealer! No!

01:00:44.050 --> 01:00:45.050
沃马克斯

01:00:46.140 --> 01:00:47.310
沃马克斯
Vermax!

01:01:00.650 --> 01:01:01.700
小杰
Jace!

01:01:10.410 --> 01:01:12.080
往下冲 月舞

01:01:12.660 --> 01:01:13.670
快点

01:02:07.550 --> 01:02:09.550
小杰
Jace!

01:02:17.900 --> 01:02:18.980
飞啊 沃马克斯
Come on, Vermax!

01:02:19.110 --> 01:02:20.110
飞啊

01:02:21.230 --> 01:02:22.280
飞啊

01:04:17.560 --> 01:04:18.560
待续

01:04:18.640 --> 01:04:19.640
谢谢观赏

01:04:21.640 --> 01:04:23.650
翻译:郭元箴
